# Release Verification

After each production deploy:

1. Run a smoke test of critical paths
2. Confirm monitoring/dashboards look healthy
3. Move the Azure DevOps work item to Done/Closed only after verification
4. Keep a clear rollback plan (slots / blue-green / previous artifact)

Zero-downtime strategy is preferred (deployment slots or equivalent).
